 "semantics": [
  "TJones declares one trivial complex parameter and Jones::Scalar. Apply it to every correlation as g_p*conj(g_q).",
  "JonesScal::setMatByOk substitutes one for invalid parameters; missing antennas are also neutral.",
  "Reuse the existing gain operator by expanding each scalar to an identical receptor pair. A scalar commutes with the other ordinary Jones factors; no new numerical kernel or resource path.",
  "G and D still require two parameters. A malformed one-parameter G table raises, matching both independent CASA refusal controls.",
  "G/D/T corruption disables weight calibration; tested t/opacity arguments leave row-time interpolation unchanged."
 ],
